title: "Mechanistic Interpretability: Geometric Contraction in Recursive Self-Observation"
abstract: "A laboratory for studying geometric signatures of recursive self-observation in transformer language models. This repository implements the R_V metric for measuring geometric contraction in value-space during recursive prompts."
